{"3739700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "咕噜咕噜海洋馆", "steam_appid": 3739700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>购买动物</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >点击右侧小岛上方的“购物车”图标，购买您的第一个海洋动物吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/extras/d8b89d5aaa6ca04bf39b7aa706ba67d1.avif?t=1750201230\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/extras_big/d8b89d5aaa6ca04bf39b7aa706ba67d1.avif?t=1750201230 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>如何喂食</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >点击右侧小岛中“鱼桶”，即可获得鱼食，选中有您可以点击海洋区域，进行喂食，点击右键即可取消选中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >注：每次喂食都需要花费一定数量的“贝壳”呦！（偷偷告诉你，右侧的大贝壳会产出高价值的珍珠哦）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/extras/78ac134a805dd6667fea52ff5f05c90e.avif?t=1750201230\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/extras_big/78ac134a805dd6667fea52ff5f05c90e.avif?t=1750201230 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>如何互动</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >点击动物，即可与动物完成交互，点击后，会有意想不到的惊喜呦！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >更多内容，等待您的探索！</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>购买动物</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >点击右侧小岛上方的“购物车”图标，购买您的第一个海洋动物吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/extras/d8b89d5aaa6ca04bf39b7aa706ba67d1.avif?t=1750201230\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/extras_big/d8b89d5aaa6ca04bf39b7aa706ba67d1.avif?t=1750201230 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>如何喂食</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >点击右侧小岛中“鱼桶”，即可获得鱼食，选中有您可以点击海洋区域，进行喂食，点击右键即可取消选中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >注：每次喂食都需要花费一定数量的“贝壳”呦！（偷偷告诉你，右侧的大贝壳会产出高价值的珍珠哦）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/extras/78ac134a805dd6667fea52ff5f05c90e.avif?t=1750201230\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/extras_big/78ac134a805dd6667fea52ff5f05c90e.avif?t=1750201230 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>如何互动</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >点击动物，即可与动物完成交互，点击后，会有意想不到的惊喜呦！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >更多内容，等待您的探索！</p>", "short_description": "欢迎来到这片蔚蓝的摸鱼天堂！在这里，你可以购买可爱的海洋萌物——养Q弹发光的水母、逗气鼓鼓的河豚、有趣的寄居蟹，甚至照顾坏笑的鲨鱼！每天喂食、摸摸头、治疗感冒打喷嚏，看着它们茁壮成长~ 还能帮你赚取贝壳币，通过在商店购买的装饰品，来装饰你的海洋牧场，打造属于你一个人的梦幻海底牧场，快来成为最会摸鱼……啊不，最会经营的海洋大亨吧！(๑•̀ㅂ•́)و✧", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/b3c4ab49cd9b90cb57c2079eef4c04128d535a4c/header.jpg?t=1750201230", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/3a51a8fbafe9b101f4e294b12321615631126258/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750201230", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739700/3a51a8fbafe9b101f4e294b12321615631126258/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750201230", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB availab